</li><li>recommendations to improve overall efficiency and public accountability;</li><li>the extent to which HUD has resources sufficient to carry out its statutory mission; and&nbsp;</li><li>ongoing activities regarding any such additional work.</li></ul>","updateDate":"2025-02-06T22:41:11Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"HUD Transparency Act of 2025","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-08-04T16:45:42Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-08-04T16:45:42Z"}
